  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\sin x=\\frac{-3}{5}, \\pi < x < \\frac{3 \\pi}{2} \\\\ & \\tan x=\\frac{3}{4} \\cos x=-\\frac{4}{5} \\\\ & 80\\left(\\tan ^2 x-\\cos x\\right) \\\\ & =80\\left(\\frac{9}{16}+\\frac{4}{5}\\right)=45+64=109\\end{aligned}$",
